    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against <strong>Soviet Robots </strong>in the new Soviet Punk action-shooter game. Witness the ruins of the <strong>Old World</strong> and the horrors of the new <strong>Dystopian Reality</strong>. Use your cybernetic powers and boundless fury to destroy the <strong>USSR </strong>once and for <strong>ALL</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/5cafbbab6819761405c1a9c89bbc32b7.avif?t=1749462299\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/425d58bfcbfc485359fd6a3e5696d298.poster.avif?t=1749462299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/425d58bfcbfc485359fd6a3e5696d298.webm?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/425d58bfcbfc485359fd6a3e5696d298.mp4?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your endless fury to defeat the Red Army. Slice through robots, and use power-ups to gain overwhelming power over them. Immerse yourself in a juicy combat atmosphere inspired by iconic titles like DOOM and Ruiner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/f52b50bab09a8b4968385a6082128d2f.avif?t=1749462299\" width=616 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/ef42ff4b5c1a3b833a83bc69facd63c1.poster.avif?t=1749462299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/ef42ff4b5c1a3b833a83bc69facd63c1.webm?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/ef42ff4b5c1a3b833a83bc69facd63c1.mp4?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where every move of yours is tracked and analyzed. Where every decision you make has already been predicted. Privacy has become an obscured memory. Between neon lights and post-soviet architecture, you will see the truth. Everything serves the System, including You.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/b8fb99dfc6a3af2081f6a5565a79657e.avif?t=1749462299\" width=616 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8cd5a9016d0838aabf7c593a4fa3597.poster.avif?t=1749462299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8cd5a9016d0838aabf7c593a4fa3597.webm?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8cd5a9016d0838aabf7c593a4fa3597.mp4?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through destroyed neighborhoods and the old-time part of the city. Catch a glimpse of life that once thrived there. See what the System did to those deemed &quot;uncooperative&quot;. Liberate them. Rebuild insurgency. Stand as one against the Red Star.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against <strong>Soviet Robots </strong>in the new Soviet Punk action-shooter game. Witness the ruins of the <strong>Old World</strong> and the horrors of the new <strong>Dystopian Reality</strong>. Use your cybernetic powers and boundless fury to destroy the <strong>USSR </strong>once and for <strong>ALL</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/5cafbbab6819761405c1a9c89bbc32b7.avif?t=1749462299\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/425d58bfcbfc485359fd6a3e5696d298.poster.avif?t=1749462299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/425d58bfcbfc485359fd6a3e5696d298.webm?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/425d58bfcbfc485359fd6a3e5696d298.mp4?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your endless fury to defeat the Red Army. Slice through robots, and use power-ups to gain overwhelming power over them. Immerse yourself in a juicy combat atmosphere inspired by iconic titles like DOOM and Ruiner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/f52b50bab09a8b4968385a6082128d2f.avif?t=1749462299\" width=616 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/ef42ff4b5c1a3b833a83bc69facd63c1.poster.avif?t=1749462299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/ef42ff4b5c1a3b833a83bc69facd63c1.webm?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/ef42ff4b5c1a3b833a83bc69facd63c1.mp4?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where every move of yours is tracked and analyzed. Where every decision you make has already been predicted. Privacy has become an obscured memory. Between neon lights and post-soviet architecture, you will see the truth. Everything serves the System, including You.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/b8fb99dfc6a3af2081f6a5565a79657e.avif?t=1749462299\" width=616 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8cd5a9016d0838aabf7c593a4fa3597.poster.avif?t=1749462299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8cd5a9016d0838aabf7c593a4fa3597.webm?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a8cd5a9016d0838aabf7c593a4fa3597.mp4?t=1749462299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through destroyed neighborhoods and the old-time part of the city. Catch a glimpse of life that once thrived there. See what the System did to those deemed &quot;uncooperative&quot;. Liberate them. Rebuild insurgency. Stand as one against the Red Star.</p>",
    "short_description": "System Breakdown is a fast-paced roguelite shooter where you wake up in an alternate world where the Soviets won the Cold War. As the experimental new weapon of destruction, fight with Soviet War Robots to liberate a free world or anything that is left of that.",
